/**
 * ============================================================================
 *                    SMART ELEVATOR SIMULATOR (PBL PROJECT)
 * ============================================================================
 * An all-in-one, fully-contained Java backend simulator for multi-elevator dispatching.
 *
 * KEY OOP DESIGN PATTERNS DEMONSTRATED:
 * 1. Strategy Pattern      : SchedulingStrategy (FCFSStrategy, NearestCarStrategy, ScanStrategy)
 * 2. State Pattern         : ElevatorState (IdleState, MovingUpState, MovingDownState, DoorsOpenState)
 * 3. Observer Pattern      : ElevatorObserver & ElevatorEvent (decoupled telemetry & metrics logging)
 * 4. Inheritance/Polymorph : abstract Request -> ExternalRequest & InternalRequest
 * 5. Encapsulation         : Elevator internal state & passenger queues hidden behind synchronized API
 * 6. Custom Exceptions     : InvalidFloorException, OverloadException
